section#tarjetas(class='mx-auto w-full max-w-[var(--main-container)] px-[15px]')
	div(class='mx-auto w-full max-w-[var(--container)]')
		hr(class='mb-8 border-0 border-t-2 border-[var(--storybook-divider)]')
		h2(class='mb-2 font-display text-[length:var(--h2-size)] leading-[length:var(--h2-line)] font-bold') Tarjetas (Cards)
		p(class='mb-8 text-[length:var(--p-size)] leading-[length:var(--p-line)] text-[var(--ageco-gray-dark)]')
			| Contenedores para KPIs e información. Encabezado en Verde Sigo Vigente.

		div(class='grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3')
			article(class='overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-[var(--border-soft)] bg-white shadow-sm')
				div(class='bg-[var(--sigo-green)] px-5 py-3')
					h3(class='m-0 text-sm font-semibold text-white') Desempleados en seguimiento
				div(class='p-5')
					p(class='m-0 font-display text-3xl font-bold text-[var(--ageco-black)]') 9
					p(class='mt-2 mb-0 text-sm text-[var(--ageco-gray-dark)]') Estado: En seguimiento

			article(class='overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-[var(--border-soft)] bg-[var(--ageco-gray)] shadow-sm')
				div(class='border-b border-[var(--border-soft)] px-5 py-3')
					h3(class='m-0 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--sigo-green)]') Voluntarios activos
				div(class='p-5')
					p(class='m-0 font-display text-3xl font-bold text-[var(--ageco-black)]') 5
					p(class='mt-2 mb-0 text-sm text-[var(--ageco-gray-dark)]') Empleo y Emprendimiento

			article(class='rounded-lg border border-[var(--ageco-red)] bg-white p-5 shadow-sm')
				h3(class='m-0 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--ageco-red)]') Acción destacada
				p(class='mt-3 mb-0 text-sm text-[var(--paragraph-color)]')
					| Ejemplo de tarjeta con acento Rojo AGECO para llamadas a la acción.
